	(text "H=28 W=28 Cin=1 Cout=8 K=5  ->  Hout=24 Wout=24\nLoop order: oc(0..7) -> oy(0..23) -> ox(0..23) -> ky(0..4) -> kx(0..4); ic=0 (Cin=1).\nMAC/point = 5x5 = 25; points = 8x24x24 = 4608; total MAC = 115200.\nInput layout HWC C=1:  IN_ADDR = (oy+ky)*28 + (ox+kx)            range 0..783\nWeight layout [oc][ky][kx]:  W_ADDR = oc*25 + ky*5 + kx          range 0..199\nOutput layout HWC C=8:  OUT_ADDR = oc*576 + oy*24 + ox          range 0..4607\nOutput order: for oc, for oy, for ox -> one uint8 per output point (little-endian byte 0 only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c57b0e7-7e6b-4187-9b78-a5abbed5d00b")
	)

	(text "Local FSM: 2x27C512 16-bit microcode (ROM1: next state + flags, ROM2: control), 74HCT273 state register, 2x74HCT574 output registers, 74HC138 state decoder."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 748 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d7138537-9725-434d-818b-aa9ef115bb50")
	)

	(text "MAC datapath: 4x LUT_Mult_Unit (S_LUT_Mult_1 interface, qualified nets LUT1..4), 4-deep input/weight pipeline (8x74HCT574), 4-product 18-bit adder tree, 32-bit accumulator (8x74HC283 + 4x74HCT574), requant core on S13 (gate-level 32x16 serial multiplier, 49-bit correction, 64-bit requant)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 756 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "996cb6f5-7aeb-4aca-9317-385939e942f0")
	)

