	(text "Microcode map (2 x 27C512):  A[4:0]=ST0..ST4; A5=START_S; A6=POINT_LAST; A7=MEM_ACK; A8=MEM_DONE; A9=REQ_DONE; A10=SP_LAST.\nROM1 D[4:0]=next state, D5=BUSY, D6=DONE, D7=ACC_CLR_N (active low).  ROM2 D0=MAC_EN, D1=MEM_REQ, D2=MEM_WE, D3=OUT_STB, D4=ADD_SEL0, D5=ADD_SEL1, D6/D7=0.\nState sequence: 0 E_RESET -> 1 E_IDLE -> 2 E_ADDR_IN -> 3 E_WAIT_A -> 4 E_ADDR_W -> 5 E_WAIT_B -> 6 E_SHIFT -> 7 E_ACC -> (loop or) 8 E_REQ -> 9 E_ADDR_OUT -> 10 E_WRITE -> 11 E_NEXT -> 12 E_DONE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 620 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "693c3ead-30db-4b72-8bde-1b59767e9056")
	)

	(text "A/B path: A_LAT/B_LAT 74HCT574 capture the S02 read data on A_LOAD/B_LOAD; four 74HCT574 stages per operand with 2:1 74HC157 hold muxes (SHIFT_EN).  Eight 27C512 per engine (two per lane) form four independent 8x8 LUT multipliers; PROD=A*B, never x*x.\nCONV1 pads 25 MACs to 28 with three zero-B MACs (PAD_ACTIVE forces the B latch to zero) so the 4-MAC accumulator groups are complete."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 650 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d561e6d0-965b-4b78-b402-4bb4afa250fc")
	)

	(text "Memory interface is shared: S02 is the only timing controller and drives MEM_nCE/nOE/nWE plus MEM_ACK/DONE/BUSY globally.  S11 merges C1_MEM_REQ/WE and encodes C1_MEM_nCE_* into REGION/MEM_SEL.  C1_ADDR is driven only while C1_BUSY=1 (74HCT541 OE = C1_BUSY_N).  The 74HC138 region decoder is qualified by the active-low MEM_nCE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 680 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f89dcc43-1b06-4c15-8171-295f3aee83fc")
	)

	(text "LUT ROMs: model/lut/lut_lo.bin and lut_hi.bin; address A[15:8]=A operand, A[7:0]=B operand; low ROM = product[7:0], high ROM = product[15:8].  All 24 ROMs (8 per engine) are independent."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 710 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "47e93049-4228-437e-adb6-59c5ed87553e")
	)

	(text "Decoupling: one 100 nF per IC (banked at S10 power entry; see BOM)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 430 740 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f9c513e1-b989-4311-869b-031c59ed64a4")
	)

